OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACall made to pause installing
OL,4,Afloating bus stops
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe London Assembly has called for a
OL,7,Fpause in the installation of floating
OL,8,Fbus stops, saying the designs have left
OL,9,Fsome people "fearing for their safety".
OL,11,FA floating bus stop, also known as a
OL,12,Fbus stop bypass or bus stop island, is
OL,13,Fa road layout where a dedicated cycle
OL,14,Flane runs behind the passenger waiting
OL,15,Farea, separating it from the main
OL,16,Fpavement.
OL,18,FThe motion passed by 17 votes to three,
OL,19,Fwith backers citing safety concerns for
OL,20,Fpartially sighted, older and disabled
OL,21,FLondoners.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
