OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1794039937
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACall made to pause installing
OL,4,Afloating bus stops
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport for London (TfL) said it has
OL,7,Fpaused bus stop designs that require
OL,8,Fpassengers to step directly into a
OL,9,Fcycle lane. However, work is continuing
OL,10,Fon three floating bus stops where
OL,11,Fcyclists pass behind the bus stop.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
